IlexForest_Interior1_Text_Fearow::
	.string "FARFETCH’D: Kwah!$"

IlexForest_Interior1_Text_Boy_1::
	.string "Oh, man... My boss is going to be\n"
	.string "steaming...\p"
	.string "The FARFETCH’D that CUTS trees\n"
	.string "for charcoal took off on me.\p"
	.string "I can’t go looking it here in the\n"
	.string "ILEX FOREST.\p"
	.string "It’s too big, dark and scary for me...$"

IlexForest_Interior1_Text_Boy_2::
	.string "Wow! Thanks a whole bunch!\p"
	.string "My boss’s POKéMON won’t obey me\n"
	.string "because I don’t have a BADGE.$"

IlexForest_Interior1_Text_Fearow2::
	.string "FARFETCH’D: Kwaa!$"

IlexForest_Interior1_Text_Rocker_1::
	.string "Ah! My FARFETCH’D!\n"
	.string "You found it for us, kid?\p"
	.string "Without it, we wouldn’t be able\n"
	.string "to CUT trees for charcoal.\p"
	.string "Thanks, kid!\p"
	.string "Now, how can I thank you...\p"
	.string "I know! Here, take this.$"

IlexForest_Interior1_Text_Rocker_2::
	.string "That’s the CUT HM.\n"
	.string "Teach that to a POKéMON to clear\l"
	.string "small trees.\p"
	.string "Of course, you have to have the\n"
	.string "GYM BADGE from AZALEA to use it.$"

IlexForest_Interior1_Text_Rocker_3::
	.string "Do you want to apprentice as a\n"
	.string "charcoal maker with me?\p"
	.string "You’ll be first-rate in ten years!$"

IlexForest_Interior1_Text_CooltrainerM_1::
	.string "What am I doing?\p"
	.string "I’m shaking trees using HEADBUTT.\p"
	.string "It’s fun. Here, you try it too!$"

IlexForest_Interior1_Text_CooltrainerM_2::
	.string "Rattle trees with HEADBUTT.\n"
	.string "Sometimes, sleeping POKéMON fall\l"
	.string "out.$"

IlexForest_Interior1_Text_Lass::
	.string "Did something happen to the\n"
	.string "forest’s guardian?$"

IlexForest_Interior1_Text_CrushGirl_1::
	.string "FRIEDA: Yahoo!\n"
	.string "It’s Friday!\p"
	.string "I’m FRIEDA of Friday!\p"
	.string "Nice to meet you!\p"
	.string "Here’s a POISON BARB for you!$"

IlexForest_Interior1_Text_CrushGirl_2::
	.string "FRIEDA: Give it to a POKéMON that\n"
	.string "has poison-type moves.\p"
	.string "Oh!\p"
	.string "It’s wicked!\p"
	.string "You’ll be shocked how good it makes\n"
	.string "poison moves!$"

IlexForest_Interior1_Text_CrushGirl_3::
	.string "FRIEDA: Hiya! What day do you like?\p"
	.string "I love Friday. No doubt about it!\p"
	.string "Don’t you think it’s great too?$"

IlexForest_Interior1_Text_Trigger19::
	.string "Whew, wasn’t that something!\p"
	.string "{PLAYER}, that was fantastic.\n"
	.string "Thanks!\p"
	.string "The legends about that SHRINE were\n"
	.string "real after all.\p"
	.string "I feel inspired by what I just saw.\p"
	.string "It motivates me to make better\n"
	.string "BALLS.\p"
	.string "I’m going!$"

IlexForest_Interior1_Text_Sign1_1::
	.string "ILEX FOREST SHRINE...\p"
	.string "It’s in honor of the forest’s\n"
	.string "protector...$"

IlexForest_Interior1_Text_Sign1_2::
	.string "Oh? What is this?\p"
	.string "It’s a hole.\n"
	.string "It looks like the GS BALL would\l"
	.string "fit inside it.\p"
	.string "Want to put the GS BALL here?$"

IlexForest_Interior1_Text_Sign2::
	.string "ILEX FOREST is so overgrown with\n"
	.string "trees that you can’t see the sky.\p"
	.string "Please watch out for items that may\n"
	.string "have been dropped.$"
